        "Full & Partial Rewires",
        "Bringing older properties up to modern safety standards, with minimal disruption to your home.",
        "Consumer Unit Upgrades",
        "Replacing outdated fuse boxes with modern, RCD-protected consumer units for total peace of mind.",
        "EV Charger Installation",
        "OZEV-approved home charging points fitted to a high standard, ready for your electric vehicle.",
        "EICR & Landlord Certificates",
        "Electrical Installation Condition Reports for landlords, homeowners and buyers, with clear reporting.",
        "Small Business Electrics",
        "Office fit-outs, shop lighting, PAT testing and ongoing electrical maintenance for local businesses.",
        "Lighting Design & Fitting",
        "From downlights to garden lighting, we design and install schemes that work for how you live.",
        "Emergency Call-Outs",
        "Power cut, tripping fuse box or burning smell? We offer a genuine 24/7 emergency response.",
        "Fault Finding & Repairs",
        "Tripping circuits, dead sockets or flickering lights diagnosed quickly and fixed properly.",
        "What We Do"
